  "name": "Crimson Invasion Prerelease Kit",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Crimson Invasion prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 21–22 and 28–29 October 2017. Each kit held four Crimson Invasion booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Crimson Invasion logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Alolan Raichu, Gengar and Bewear, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
